# Accepted `pnpm audit --prod` advisories, by advisory id.
#
# These are transitive dependencies of packages we don't control, with no
# patched version published upstream — there is nothing to upgrade to. They are
# listed here so the pre-push nudge stays quiet about them and only speaks up
# for advisories that are NEW, which are the ones that might be actionable.
#
# `pnpm deps:check` always prints the full audit regardless of this file.
#
# Re-check occasionally: when an upstream ships a fix, drop the line and bump
# the dependency. Blank lines and #-comments are ignored.
#
# Emptied 2026-09-23: all previously baselined advisories were resolved by
# dependency bumps and pnpm.overrides in package.json.
